  "excerpt": "Yesterday I wrote about my travails with watercolor painting, so today I just want to call out that sketching, ink and color pencils are much much easier for me. Maybe because of the lack of time pressure and also because sketching is the form of art that I have the most reps with all my […]",
  "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yesterday I wrote about my travails with <a href=\"https://blog.eeshans.com/2026/08/28/watercolor-is-hard/\">watercolor painting</a>, so today I just want to call out that sketching, ink and color pencils are much much easier for me. Maybe because of the lack of time pressure and also because sketching is the form of art that I have the most reps with all my life. It&#8217;s also much easier to add light &amp; shadow effects using just pressure instead of color mixing, which is fundamentally easier and can be done instantly while you&#8217;re shading with the pencil or color pencil. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here&#8217;s a sketch of the Dursleys / Harry Potter&#8217;s residence &#8211; <a href=\"https://harrypotter.fandom.com/wiki/4_Privet_Drive\">4 Privet Drive</a>. It&#8217;s the same window from which Harry escaped in the Weasley&#8217;s flying car. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/c21ae492-b7cd-4922-94bd-c7bae4250248.jpg?ssl=1\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"4284\" height=\"5712\" data-attachment-id=\"1571\" data-permalink=\"https://blog.eeshans.com/2026/08/29/sketching-is-easy/c21ae492-b7cd-4922-94bd-c7bae4250248/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/c21ae492-b7cd-4922-94bd-c7bae4250248.jpg?fit=4284%2C5712&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"4284,5712\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"C21AE492-B7CD-4922-94BD-C7BAE4250248\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/c21ae492-b7cd-4922-94bd-c7bae4250248.jpg?fit=768%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/c21ae492-b7cd-4922-94bd-c7bae4250248.jpg?resize=4284%2C5712&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1571\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ink makes your drawing pop naturally and you can use just ink as well as in my sketch of St. Petersburg below. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/716e7a6a-d5e5-4489-89a2-8922d093965b_1_105_c.jpeg?ssl=1\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" data-attachment-id=\"1572\" data-permalink=\"https://blog.eeshans.com/2026/08/29/sketching-is-easy/716e7a6a-d5e5-4489-89a2-8922d093965b_1_105_c/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/716e7a6a-d5e5-4489-89a2-8922d093965b_1_105_c.jpeg?fit=768%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"768,1024\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;2.2&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;iPhone 14 Pro&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1704499036&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;2.22&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;1600&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0.033333333333333&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;latitude&quot;:&quot;47.623294444444&quot;,&quot;longitude&quot;:&quot;-122.20271944444&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"716E7A6A-D5E5-4489-89A2-8922D093965B_1_105_c\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/716e7a6a-d5e5-4489-89a2-8922d093965b_1_105_c.jpeg?fit=768%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/716e7a6a-d5e5-4489-89a2-8922d093965b_1_105_c.jpeg?resize=768%2C1024&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1572\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Or sometimes, you can just use the pencil to shade and let it be. A sketch of my friend&#8217;s cat &#8211; Kiki &#8211; below. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bcdaa150-750a-4db9-908b-61b886dacafa_1_105_c.jpeg?ssl=1\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"665\" height=\"1182\" data-attachment-id=\"1574\" data-permalink=\"https://blog.eeshans.com/2026/08/29/sketching-is-easy/bcdaa150-750a-4db9-908b-61b886dacafa_1_105_c/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bcdaa150-750a-4db9-908b-61b886dacafa_1_105_c.jpeg?fit=665%2C1182&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"665,1182\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;1.8&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;iPhone 11 Pro&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1672271381&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;4.25&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;1250&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0.025&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"BCDAA150-750A-4DB9-908B-61B886DACAFA_1_105_c\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bcdaa150-750a-4db9-908b-61b886dacafa_1_105_c.jpeg?fit=576%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.eeshans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bcdaa150-750a-4db9-908b-61b886dacafa_1_105_c.jpeg?resize=665%2C1182&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1574\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">That&#8217;s all I wanted to say in this post. Watercolor is hard, sketching is easy. Do what you can do often to keep your skills. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Good night folks!</p>\n",
